<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
  Offline fallback AdMob ad unit ids, one per placement.

  The live values come from the `ad_ids` Remote Config parameter. These are what serve on a
  first cold start, before Remote Config has ever resolved, and whenever the device is offline -
  so they should stay in step with the console template in
  `remote_config_default/ad_ids.json`. The app id itself lives in strings.xml as admob_app_id.

  AdUnits.kt reads these. It also serves Google's test ids in debug builds regardless of both
  this file and the remote value, so a developer running locally can never spend a real
  impression.

  Note the separator: the application id uses '~', ad unit ids use '/'.
-->
